{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1415AF, but you are outside of space, outside of time, on a planet of eternal night ruled by an obscene and fickle god who keeps the planet's few inhabitants in a perpetual cycle of non-consensual reincarnation. Your only way to escape is to win a dressage competition.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings, form allegiances, learn occult knowledge, take care of deadly beasts and ride them into the manege in a series of murderous dressage tests. Will you become the planet's next dressage champion and be granted a single wish  from its omnipotent god or will you succumb and remain a slave for eternity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532330/extras/b73bf0e4317674807ee144f2667e8ccb.avif?t=1756315506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532330/extras_big/b73bf0e4317674807ee144f2667e8ccb.webp?t=1756315506 width=1560 height=1417 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532330?t=1756315506","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532330?t=1756315506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532330/c476866c5f04a2232e66af73e3d1f0c5bce748e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756315506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532330/c476866c5f04a2232e66af73e3d1f0c5bce748e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756315506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1415AF, but you are outside of space, outsi